WEBVTT

00:02:58.756 --> 00:03:01.516
like Canada, Finland and Siberia.

00:03:03.876 --> 00:03:07.516
This extreme heat kills hundreds
of thousands of people.

00:03:08.076 --> 00:03:10.316
It fuels raging wildfires,

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:13.756
turning towns, forests
and grasslands into ashes,

00:03:14.556 --> 00:03:19.196
also killing billions
of individual animals and trees

00:03:19.236 --> 00:03:22.036
and many coral reefs around the world.

00:03:24.716 --> 00:03:27.316
No place is safe anymore

00:03:28.236 --> 00:03:31.436
unless we rewild our planet.